Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 17:04:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] SYCL MoE mat-vec: Q5_0 through local memory (coalesced
 32-bit row loads, a whole block per work-item)

Inkling 2 Mini Uncensored AD-Q4_K has Q5_0 expert down projections (k = 1152): 8 experts, n = 1,
94 -> 34 us (test-backend-ops perf); tg64 46.4 -> 57.6. GGML_SYCL_Q5_0_MOE_SLM=0 restores the old path.
INKLING_SHAPES perf cases include Q5_0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Co-Authored-By: otaliptus <56600661+otaliptus@users.noreply.github.com>
